1
00:00:00,430 --> 00:00:02,790
(Amy:)We postulate an alternate
world that differs from ours

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,310
(Amy:)in one key aspect and then
pose questions to each other.

3
00:00:05,310 --> 00:00:07,150
It's fun for ages eight to 80.

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:08,600
(Sheldon:)Join us.

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,100
(Sheldon:)All right.

6
00:00:10,100 --> 00:00:11,570
(Leonard:)I like a good brainteaser.

7
00:00:11,570 --> 00:00:13,150
(Leonard:)Give it a whirl.

8
00:00:13,160 --> 00:00:14,740
You're in luck;
this is an easy one.

9
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,790
(Sheldon:)In a world where mankind is ruled

10
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:20,310
(Sheldon:)by a giant intelligent beaver,

11
00:00:20,310 --> 00:00:22,780
(Sheldon:)what food is no longer consumed?

12
00:00:22,780 --> 00:00:27,690
(Leonard:)Uh... a BLT where the
"B" stands for beaver?

13
00:00:27,690 --> 00:00:28,900
(Leonard:)I don't know.

14
00:00:28,900 --> 00:00:30,990
(Sheldon:)Leonard, be serious.

15
00:00:30,990 --> 00:00:32,760
(Sheldon:)We're playing a game here.

16
00:00:32,760 --> 00:00:33,710
(clears throat)

17
00:00:33,710 --> 00:00:34,830
(Leonard:)I can figure this out.

18
00:00:34,830 --> 00:00:35,860
(Leonard:)Let's see.

19
00:00:35,860 --> 00:00:38,630
(Leonard:)Um, well, beavers eat tree bark.

20
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:42,020
(Leonard:)The only tree bark I know that
humans consume is cinnamon.

21
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,640
(Leonard:)So, I'll say cinnamon.

22
00:00:43,640 --> 00:00:44,670
(Sheldon:)Incorrect.

23
00:00:44,670 --> 00:00:48,160
(Sheldon:)Obviously, the answer
is cheese Danish.

24
00:00:48,160 --> 00:00:49,510
(Leonard:)What?

25
00:00:49,510 --> 00:00:52,230
(Amy:)In a world ruled by a giant beaver,

26
00:00:52,230 --> 00:00:55,510
(Amy:)mankind builds many dams to
please the beaver overlord.

27
00:00:55,510 --> 00:00:57,900
(Amy:)The low-lying city of
Copenhagen is flooded.

28
00:00:57,900 --> 00:00:59,180
(Amy:)Thousands die.

29
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:05,020
(Amy:)Devastated, the Danes never
invent their namesake pastry.

